\ tests/native/kernel-locals.4 - shadow.4's locals, which the native
\ kernel's SLOT, lays as groups since Iteration 655: a definition's run of
\ saves as one, each exit's run of restores as one. Runs of every length
\ to 9 and of 16, as arguments; values, zeroed; two exits; a word with
\ locals inside another's and in a loop; recursion; every variable as it
\ was after all of them; and the save stack's overflow, last - it leaves
\ the stack full. Native, CV8-asm and CV8-C print the same. Lines short:
\ the kernel reads a long one cut.
S" forth/pool.4" INCLUDED
S" forth/shadow.4" INCLUDED
VARIABLE L1 VARIABLE L2 VARIABLE L3 VARIABLE L4 VARIABLE L5 VARIABLE L6 VARIABLE L7 VARIABLE L8
VARIABLE L9 VARIABLE L10 VARIABLE L11 VARIABLE L12 VARIABLE L13 VARIABLE L14 VARIABLE L15 VARIABLE L16
: SET-ALL ( --- )  1001 L1 ! 1002 L2 ! 1003 L3 ! 1004 L4 ! 1005 L5 !
  1006 L6 ! 1007 L7 ! 1008 L8 ! 1009 L9 ! 1010 L10 ! 1011 L11 ! 1012 L12
  ! 1013 L13 ! 1014 L14 ! 1015 L15 ! 1016 L16 ! ;
: SUM-ALL ( --- n )  0 L1 @ 1 * + L2 @ 2 * + L3 @ 3 * + L4 @ 4 * + L5 @
  5 * + L6 @ 6 * + L7 @ 7 * + L8 @ 8 * + L9 @ 9 * + L10 @ 10 * + L11 @
  11 * + L12 @ 12 * + L13 @ 13 * + L14 @ 14 * + L15 @ 15 * + L16 @ 16 *
  + ;
: W1  SHADOW{ L1 }
  0 L1 @ 1 * + ;
: W2  SHADOW{ L1 L2 }
  0 L1 @ 1 * + L2 @ 2 * + ;
: W3  SHADOW{ L1 L2 L3 }
  0 L1 @ 1 * + L2 @ 2 * + L3 @ 3 * + ;
: W4  SHADOW{ L1 L2 L3 L4 }
  0 L1 @ 1 * + L2 @ 2 * + L3 @ 3 * + L4 @ 4 * + ;
: W5  SHADOW{ L1 L2 L3 L4 L5 }
  0 L1 @ 1 * + L2 @ 2 * + L3 @ 3 * + L4 @ 4 * + L5 @ 5 * + ;
: W6  SHADOW{ L1 L2 L3 L4 L5 L6 }
  0 L1 @ 1 * + L2 @ 2 * + L3 @ 3 * + L4 @ 4 * + L5 @ 5 * + L6 @ 6 * + ;
: W7  SHADOW{ L1 L2 L3 L4 L5 L6 L7 }
  0 L1 @ 1 * + L2 @ 2 * + L3 @ 3 * + L4 @ 4 * + L5 @ 5 * + L6 @ 6 * + L7
  @ 7 * + ;
: W8  SHADOW{ L1 L2 L3 L4 L5 L6 L7 L8 }
  0 L1 @ 1 * + L2 @ 2 * + L3 @ 3 * + L4 @ 4 * + L5 @ 5 * + L6 @ 6 * + L7
  @ 7 * + L8 @ 8 * + ;
: W9  SHADOW{ L1 L2 L3 L4 L5 L6 L7 L8 L9 }
  0 L1 @ 1 * + L2 @ 2 * + L3 @ 3 * + L4 @ 4 * + L5 @ 5 * + L6 @ 6 * + L7
  @ 7 * + L8 @ 8 * + L9 @ 9 * + ;
: W16  SHADOW{ L1 L2 L3 L4 L5 L6 L7 L8 L9 L10 L11 L12 L13 L14 L15 L16 }
  0 L1 @ 1 * + L2 @ 2 * + L3 @ 3 * + L4 @ 4 * + L5 @ 5 * + L6 @ 6 * + L7
  @ 7 * + L8 @ 8 * + L9 @ 9 * + L10 @ 10 * + L11 @ 11 * + L12 @ 12 * +
  L13 @ 13 * + L14 @ 14 * + L15 @ 15 * + L16 @ 16 * + ;
SET-ALL
11 W1 . CR
11 21 W2 . CR
11 21 31 W3 . CR
11 21 31 41 W4 . CR
11 21 31 41 51 W5 . CR
11 21 31 41 51 61 W6 . CR
11 21 31 41 51 61 71 W7 . CR
11 21 31 41 51 61 71 81 W8 . CR
11 21 31 41 51 61 71 81 91 W9 . CR
11 21 31 41 51 61 71 81 91 101 111 121 131 141 151 161 W16 . CR
SUM-ALL . CR
: AV ( a b --- n )  SHADOW{ L1 L2 | L3 L4 L5 }
  L3 @ L4 @ + L5 @ +  L1 @ L2 @ - +  7 L3 ! ;
: EE ( x y --- z )  SHADOW{ L1 L2 | L3 }
  L1 @ 0 = IF L2 @ EXIT THEN  L1 @ L2 @ * ;
: INNER ( x --- y )  SHADOW{ L1 | L2 }  L1 @ 3 * L2 !  L2 @ 1+ ;
: OUTER ( x --- y )  SHADOW{ L1 | L2 }  L1 @ INNER L2 !  L2 @ L1 @ + ;
: LOOPY ( --- n )  0  1000 0 DO  I 7 W2 +  LOOP ;
: RSUM ( n --- s )  SHADOW{ L1 | L2 }
  L1 @ 0 = IF 0 EXIT THEN  L1 @ 1- RECURSE L2 !  L2 @ L1 @ + ;
9 4 AV .  0 5 EE .  6 5 EE .  5 OUTER .  LOOPY .  200 RSUM . CR
SUM-ALL . CR
\ sixteen cells a frame, 4096 in the stack: 256 frames fit, so the last
\ to run is 300's 256th, n 45 - a check one group too late says 44
VARIABLE LAST-N
: OV ( n --- )
  SHADOW{ L1 | L2 L3 L4 L5 L6 L7 L8 L9 L10 L11 L12 L13 L14 L15 L16 }
  L1 @ LAST-N !  L1 @ IF L1 @ 1- RECURSE THEN ;
300 OV
LAST-N @ . CR
.( end) CR
BYE
